Topics and json format for childs´ Arduino - publisher (both backend and parent Arduino are subsribers):

child/telemetry:
{
"temperature_c": 00.0,
"humidity_pct": 00.0,
"light_level": "very_low"/"low"/"medium"/ "high"/"very_high"
 "timestamp": "2026-11-17T11:20:00Z"
}

child/event/duration:
{
"event_id": ...,
"type": "sleep"/"walk",
"action": "start"/"stop",
 "timestamp": "2026-11-17T11:20:00Z"
}

child/event/instant:
{
"event_id": ...,
"type": "eat"/"diaper",
"timestamp": "2026-11-17T11:20:00Z"
}

Backend sands to parents´ Arduino, if connection was lost:

child/status
{
  "state": "offline",
  "last_seen": "2026-11-17T14:40:00Z"
}

Parent Arduino subscriber to all 4 topics
